    "text": "On Saturday I got up late and had a big breakfast. I went to the market and bought some fruit. Then I met my friend Kim. We ate pizza and saw a film. I came home at ten and wrote a message to my mother.",
    "es": "El sábado me levanté tarde y tomé un gran desayuno. Fui al mercado y compré fruta. Luego me encontré con mi amiga Kim. Comimos pizza y vimos una película. Volví a casa a las diez y le escribí un mensaje a mi madre.",
    "glossary": [
      {
